flowchart TB
    subgraph Booking["FR-02/03/04 · booking one or more named rooms"]
        Search["Find guest and search requested nights"] --> Offer{"Confirm now?"}
        Offer -->|No| Draft["Pending reservation · no inventory hold"]
        Draft -->|Later confirmation| Lock["Lock rooms in ID order; recheck whole interval"]
        Offer -->|Yes| Lock
        Lock --> Free{"All selected rooms active and free of blocking claims?"}
        Free -->|No| Reject["Reject the whole command; no partial allocation"]
        Free -->|Yes| Confirm["Confirmed · all rooms and agreed rates committed"]
        Confirm -->|Cancel before admission| Cancel["Release claims and retain booking history"]
    end
    subgraph Stay["FR-03/05/06/07 · one stay and one folio"]
        Confirm --> Admit{"Eligible arrival and every room vacant, inspected and unblocked?"}
        Admit -->|No| Refuse["Refuse admission; no folio or partial check-in"]
        Admit -->|Yes| Active["Check in all rooms; open one folio and post agreed room nights"]
        Active -->|If room service requested| Order["Choose booked room for multi-room stay; order at snapshot prices"]
        Order -->|When served| Serve["Commit served state and charge together, once"]
        Active -->|If funds received| Tender["Finance records verified tender; one receipt per reference"]
        Active -->|Request departure| Review["Lock reservation, folio and related orders"]
        Serve -->|Later checkout request| Review
        Tender -->|Later checkout request| Review
        Review --> CanClose{"Active stay, no open room order and zero balance?"}
        CanClose -->|No| RefuseClose["Keep stay, folio and room state; resolve cause before retry"]
        CanClose -->|Yes| Departure["Atomic checkout: close folio, stamp departure, mark each room dirty and create its pending task"]
    end
    Departure --> Queue["Turnover queue reflects the commit; the next guest still needs admission checks"]
